  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Astrologian 11, Nocturnal Sect</p><p>At 11th level, while under the Nocturnal Sect, the astrologian's connection to the moon makes her supernaturally perceptive. She gains darkvision to a range of 60 feet (or 120 feet if she already has darkvision). At 14th level, as a standard action, she can focus on a specific object or area (the size of which can be no greater than a 10-foot-by-10-foot square) and see it as though with true seeing as long as the moon is shining on it. Moonless nights, cloudy skies, and shadows interfere with this ability.</p>",
